      "content": "it's just hard because they look at me like i'm this perfect version of myself, and now that the illusion is gone, i feel like i'm just a burden to them. if i can't be the person they need me to be, what am i actually worth? it feels like there's no way to get back to how things were, and i just hate that they'll have to watch me fail for years.",
